B.WL=new A.cn(B.co,"Everyone in your society can read this, with your name and flat number. Be kind, and don't share anyone's phone number or health details.",null,"Know more",null,null)
B.WM=new A.cn(B.er,"Worked out on this phone from your family's own data: nothing is sent anywhere and no AI service is used. These are reminders, not a diagnosis: always follow your doctor.",null,"Know more",null,null)
