B.WO=new A.cn(B.UF,"A registered pharmacist checks the prescription and sends the price, usually within an hour (8 AM to 9 PM). Cheaper generic medicines are offered where the doctor allows. You pay only after seeing the price.",null,"Know more",null,null)
B.WP=new A.cn(B.co,"Check each name and flat number in your own register. You see nothing else about residents: their health details stay private.",null,"Know more",null,null)
B.WQ=new A.cn(B.co,"The video room is private to your consult: only you and the doctor have its link. Calls are not recorded by PulseGrid.",null,"Know more",null,null)
B.WR=new A.cn(B.co,"The collector is trained and uses a new sealed kit each time. Reports come within 24\u201348 hours: add them to the Health vault.",null,"Know more",null,null)
B.WS=new A.cn(B.co,"Secure payment by Razorpay: UPI, cards and netbanking. PulseGrid never sees your card.",null,"Know more",null,null)
B.WT=new A.cn(B.co,"Stored encrypted in India. Shared with a medic only during an SOS for this person.",null,"Know more",null,null)
B.WU=new A.cn(B.co,"PulseGrid never gets your passwords, messages or contacts from another app, only what a link is for, and only after you say yes.",null,"Know more",null,null)
B.WV=new A.cn(B.da,"PulseGrid isn't in the App Store or Play Store yet. Added to the home screen like this, it opens and works like any app, and new versions arrive by themselves.",null,"Know more",null,null)
B.WW=new A.cn(B.co,"Stored privately in India. Only your family account can open it.",null,"Know more",null,null)
